    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Dancer Hong Yun places the incomplete immortal formation on a sand dune, showing that the formation can be moved. Fang Yuan learns that the incomplete formation contains formation flag Immortal Gu. Immortal Gu Formation Flag at rank seven is one of the Immortal Gu he needs, and he obtains the incomplete formation in exchange for immortal materials from Thousand Transformations’ will.",
        "chapters": [
          1418
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-seven-prize",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "char_thousand_transformations_ancestor"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He later adds earth vein Immortal Gu, Formation Spirit, and Formation Flag to the five regional limit formation. While recuperating he raises all of the Immortal Gu in that formation to rank eight.",
